---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="SHUNKOH | Service サービス" activePage="service">

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="header-title-row appear">
      <h1 class="page-title">Service</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">サービス</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:14px;height:14px;background:#3397e2;top:79px;left:26px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:10px;height:10px;background:#0e3b7b;bottom:72px;left:39px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#d3c8a5;top:101px;left:78px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:14px;height:14px;background:#d3c8a5;bottom:105px;right:281px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:10px;height:10px;background:#0f3b7c;bottom:82px;right:211px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#0571c1;bottom:111px;right:180px;"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Hero Image -->
  <div class="hero-img-wrap appear" style="transition-delay:.1s">
    <img src="/images/s-2400x1108_v-frms_webp_dfc6e7c0-984d-43df-8a03-5ee6af57bf3f_regular.webp" alt="Service hero" />
  </div>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="intro-section">
    <p class="intro-text appear">
      事業の成長に必要な3つの要素「戦略 × 仕組み化 × 販路開拓」を<br />
      一気通貫でサポートします。<br />
      中小企業の経営者に寄り添い、実行支援型で伴走します。
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Pillars & Service Cards -->
  <section class="pillars-section">
    <div class="section-label-row appear">
      <div class="label-line"></div>
      <h2 class="label-text">3 Pillars</h2>
      <div class="label-line"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-heading appear" style="transition-delay:.1s">3つの柱</p>

    <div class="pillars-row appear" style="transition-delay:.2s">
      <div class="pillar-badge">
        <span class="pillar-badge-en">Brain</span>
        <span class="pillar-badge-jp">戦略</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-connector"></div>
      <div class="pillar-center">
        <span class="pillar-center-text">事業<br>成長</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-connector"></div>
      <div class="pillar-badge">
        <span class="pillar-badge-en">Body</span>
        <span class="pillar-badge-jp">仕組み化</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar-connector"></div>
      <div class="pillar-badge">
        <span class="pillar-badge-en">Legs</span>
        <span class="pillar-badge-jp">販路開拓</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-cards">
      <div class="service-card appear" style="transition-delay:.1s">
        <div class="service-card-icon"><span class="material-icons">psychology</span></div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <p class="service-card-en">Brain</p>
          <p class="service-card-jp">戦略</p>
          <p class="service-card-desc">
            現状の経営課題を深く分析し、明確な目標と中長期の経営戦略を策定します。
            経営者の思考を整理し、自社の強みを最大化する方向性を一緒に描きます。
          </p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>経営課題の洗い出しと優先順位付け</li>
            <li>中長期経営計画の策定</li>
            <li>SWOT分析・競合分析</li>
            <li>KPI設計と進捗管理体制の構築</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card appear" style="transition-delay:.2s">
        <div class="service-card-icon"><span class="material-icons">settings</span></div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <p class="service-card-en">Body</p>
          <p class="service-card-jp">仕組み化</p>
          <p class="service-card-desc">
            業務プロセスを可視化・標準化し、属人化を解消します。
            組織として継続的に成果を生み出せる仕組みを構築し、
            経営者がより重要な仕事に集中できる環境を整えます。
          </p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>業務フローの可視化と標準化</li>
            <li>マニュアル・ドキュメント整備</li>
            <li>チームビルディング支援</li>
            <li>ITツール活用による業務効率化</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card appear" style="transition-delay:.3s">
        <div class="service-card-icon"><span class="material-icons">store</span></div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <p class="service-card-en">Legs</p>
          <p class="service-card-jp">販路開拓</p>
          <p class="service-card-desc">
            新規顧客の獲得から既存顧客の深耕、パートナーとの連携まで、
            多角的なアプローチで売上拡大を実現します。
            20年以上のtoB営業経験と400社以上の支援実績を活かします。
          </p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>新規顧客開拓戦略の立案と実行</li>
            <li>営業プロセスの改善</li>
            <li>パートナー・アライアンス戦略</li>
            <li>マーケティング施策の企画・実行</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Case Studies -->
  <section class="cases-section">
    <div class="section-label-row appear">
      <div class="label-line"></div>
      <h2 class="label-text">Case Studies</h2>
      <div class="label-line"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-heading cases-heading appear" style="transition-delay:.1s">事例</p>

    <div class="case-table appear" style="transition-delay:.2s">
      <div class="case-row case-row-head">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">業種・業態</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">支援内容</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">成果イメージ</div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-row">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">
          <span class="material-icons case-icon case-icon-manufacturing">precision_manufacturing</span>
          <span class="case-industry-label">製造業</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">事業戦略・市場分析・販路開拓・調達最適化・原価低減・生産効率化・SCM最適化・事業承継</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">コスト削減と新規取引先の獲得により、売上・利益の拡大</div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-row">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">
          <span class="material-icons case-icon case-icon-agriculture">agriculture</span>
          <span class="case-industry-label">農業生産者</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">差別化戦略・ブランディング・販路開拓</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">自然栽培・有機栽培品の直販チャネル確立・単価アップ</div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-row">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">
          <span class="material-icons case-icon case-icon-apartment">apartment</span>
          <span class="case-industry-label">建物管理・建築会社</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">事業戦略・マーケティング・仕組み化・販路開拓</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">見込み客の発掘、受注の安定化・業務効率化により、売上・利益の拡大</div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-row">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">
          <span class="material-icons case-icon case-icon-computer">computer</span>
          <span class="case-industry-label">システム会社</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">情報発信・ブランディング・SNS戦略</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">魅力発信、見込み客との接点拡大</div>
      </div>

      <div class="case-row">
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-industry">
          <span class="material-icons case-icon case-icon-video">videocam</span>
          <span class="case-industry-label">テレビ制作会社・葬儀業他</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-support">人材確保定着・採用戦略支援</div>
        <div class="case-cell case-cell-result">採用計画・人材要件・魅力棚卸しにより採用コスト削減・定着率向上</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact CTA -->
  <section class="contact-section appear">
    <span class="contact-watermark">Contact Us</span>
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <div class="contact-text-col">
        <h2 class="contact-heading">お問い合わせ</h2>
        <p class="contact-desc">初回ご相談は無料となっております。<br>どんな小さなことでも、まずはお気軽にご相談ください。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-btn-col">
        <a class="contact-btn" href="/contact">
          <span class="material-icons">mail_outline</span>
          <p class="contact-btn-label">お問い合わせフォームへ</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:14px;height:14px;background:#ffffff;bottom:127px;left:104px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:10px;height:10px;background:#0e3b7b;bottom:53px;left:148px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#d3c8a5;bottom:39px;left:70px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:14px;height:14px;background:#d3c8a5;top:34px;right:90px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:10px;height:10px;background:#0f3b7c;top:73px;right:193px;"></div>
    <div class="dot" style="width:8px;height:8px;background:#ffffff;top:93px;right:134px;"></div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
body { background: var(--navy); }
.main { background: var(--navy); }

.intro-section { width: 100%; padding: 60px 60px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
.intro-text { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 2; text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 20px; }

.pillars-section { width: 100%; background: var(--navy2); padding: 80px 60px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
.section-heading { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.7; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; }
.pillars-row { width: 100%; max-width: 960px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 60px; }
.pillar-connector { width: 40px; height: 2px; background: var(--sand); flex-shrink: 0; }
.pillar-badge { width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue2); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.pillar-badge-en { font-family: var(--font-en); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); }
.pillar-badge-jp { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-top: 2px; }
.pillar-center { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--navy); border: 3px solid var(--sand); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.pillar-center-text { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sand); text-align: center; line-height: 1.6; }

.service-cards { width: 100%; max-width: 960px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }
.service-card { background: var(--blue); border-radius: 40px; padding: 54px 60px; display: flex; gap: 50px; align-items: flex-start; }
.service-card:nth-child(even) { flex-direction: row-reverse; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
.service-card-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--blue2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.service-card-icon .material-icons { font-size: 40px; color: var(--white); }
.service-card-body { flex: 1; }
.service-card-en { font-family: var(--font-en); font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sand); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.service-card-jp { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px; }
.service-card-desc { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.service-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.service-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); line-height: 1.7; }
.service-list li::before { content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue3); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 8px; }

.cases-section { width: 100%; background: var(--navy); padding: 80px 60px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
.cases-heading { color: var(--white); }
.case-table { width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
.case-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr 1fr; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
.case-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.case-row-head { background: var(--blue2); }
.case-row-head .case-cell { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); text-align: center; justify-content: center; }
.case-cell { padding: 24px 20px; font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 1.8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.case-cell-industry { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); font-weight: 500; color: var(--white); flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; text-align: center; }
.case-industry-label { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; }
.case-icon { font-size: 48px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.case-icon-manufacturing { color: #3397e2; }
.case-icon-agriculture { color: #5aa469; }
.case-icon-apartment { color: #d3c8a5; }
.case-icon-computer { color: #6c7ae0; }
.case-icon-video { color: #e07a5f; }

@media (max-width: 960px) {
  .service-card { flex-direction: column !important; padding: 40px 30px; gap: 24px; }
  .pillars-row { gap: 0; }
  .case-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .case-row-head { display: none; }
  .case-cell { padding: 18px 24px; }
  .case-cell-industry { flex-direction: row; text-align: left; gap: 16px; }
  .case-icon { font-size: 36px; }
  .case-industry-label { font-size: 17px; }
  .case-cell-support::before { content: '支援内容　'; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); }
  .case-cell-result::before { content: '成果イメージ　'; font-weight: 700; color: var(--white); }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .pillars-section { padding: 40px 24px; }
  .intro-section { padding: 40px 24px 0; }
  .cases-section { padding: 40px 24px; }
  .case-cell { padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 13px; }
}
</style>
